msgstr "İstediğiniz kadar az veya çok alan adı bilgisini içe aktarabilirsiniz."

#: domains/csv-importer/index.php:138
msgid "Technically you can fill in nothing but a list of domains, and it will import just fine, but DomainMOD will need to create a bunch of generic assets for you. It's ok though, even if you go this route it's pretty easy to update the information that %s creates for you."
